{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-1","storyName":"花格窗边的梦想","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"决定分头行动后，祥子率先找到了爱丽丝笔友安的住址，并亲眼目睹了安悲惨的生活。在安成年前的最后时刻，祥子为她弹奏了一首安眠曲。为表感谢，爱丽丝送给了祥子一条项链，而祥子戴上后，却发现自己身处一座巨大的城堡里。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["爱丽丝","贝娜","丰川祥子","红豆","卖花的妇人","醉酒的男人","衣衫褴褛的少女","安","？？？","疑惑的干员","三角初华"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"animtext","id":10,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>维多利亚偏僻小镇</><p=2>9:37 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"animtextclean","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.6","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","delay":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"比之前预计的时间晚了整整四个小时......","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"没有多少时间了......","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"街上完全没有人，这种地方也不可能有地图......这下麻烦了。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不如我们分头去找，有情况就用通讯器联络。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"是个不错的主意......","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"等等，其他人我都没有意见......","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"但祥子你没有单独行动的经验，我不会让你一个人去的。","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"现在不是考虑这种事情的时候吧？","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"她信里不是已经写了，“这是我的最后一封信。”","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"万一出现什么意外，那个少女......","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"可是......！","id":37},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slapcloth_light","volume":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......红豆，没事的。","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"鞭刃小姐不是说过吗，以我现在的能力，我已经可以加入行动小组了。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（拿出通讯器）要是遇到麻烦，我一定第一时间联系你，好吗？","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"嗯，还有我们呢！","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"......好吧。那你一定要小心。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯。爱丽丝小姐，那个孩子的名字和地址是？","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"她叫“安”......地址是“花园街33号”。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"好。那我们就从这个十字路口开始，分头去找吧！","id":55},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":58},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.7","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"step1","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keeprunning","volume":"1","channel":"step2","loop":"true","delay":"0.2","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","channel":"step3","delay":"0.5","id":62},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"2.5","id":63},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step2","fadetime":"2","id":64},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step3","fadetime":"3.5","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":66},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":75},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2.5","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呼——呼——怎么这里的路都这么复杂？","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那边好像有个人......在卖花？","id":79},{"type":"multiline","name":"丰川祥子","text":"为什么这个时间了还有人在卖花......","id":80},{"type":"multiline","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不管了，找人要紧！","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"您好——！","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","duration":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"您好，请问您知道花园街在哪吗？","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"这里就是花园街。小姑娘，你要买花吗？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不，我不买花......请问您知道花园街33号怎么走吗？","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"你抬头看看天上，朝着夕阳，往西边一直走到巷尾，最后那家就是33号了。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"老奶奶，现在已经是晚上了......","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"唔，我真是老糊涂了......我说怎么这路上一点脚步声都没有，我也该收摊回家了。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"您看不见吗......？","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"不用管我，你不是还在找地方吗？快去吧。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"夜黑灯暗，可不要再迷路了。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"谢谢......您也注意安全。","id":106},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":114,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":116},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"animtext","id":119,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>花园街33号</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":120},{"type":"animtextclean","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"往西边一直走......这里就是那个老奶奶说的地方了。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":128},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"祥子缓缓推开破旧的木门，门框发出尖锐的吱呀声。","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔......好大的酒味？！","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"地板上满是带着泥水的鞋印，而房间的尽头是一个穿着邋遢的男人。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"男人环顾四周，接着一个个地拿起角落里摆放整齐的酒瓶。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"空的......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bottlebroken","volume":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"空的......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bottlebroken","volume":"1","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"......还是空的！","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bottlebroken","volume":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"安娜！安娜！！","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"你到底到哪里去了？！","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"呜呜，你是不是也和那个女人一样，丢下我跑了？！","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_416_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"唔......安娜......安娜......","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"我再也不喝酒了！我会从现在开始努力！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_416_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"男人痛苦地跪倒，随之而来的是一声惨叫。","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"方才打碎的酒瓶的碎片，毫不留情地刺入了他的掌心。","id":172},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"啊！安娜，这地板上......血......我流血了！","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"我要死了！安娜，快回来！我要死了！！","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"安娜......你回来了？","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我不是安娜。","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwlstps","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"sf","id":184},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"4","channel":"sf","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"你是安娜......你是安娜！","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的男人","text":"你不认识我了吗？是我啊。","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"男人朝祥子爬了过来，可很快又是一声惨叫。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"不知为何，祥子感到一阵强烈的伤感。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"她用手扶住了残缺的门沿——","id":192},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_closedoorheavy","volume":"1","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","duration":"0.7","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣衫褴褛的少女","text":"......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣衫褴褛的少女","text":"我——","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"走吧。","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_bg_bg_ibchurch.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"其实那篇没有发表的故事，才是你身上真实发生过的事情？","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......嗯。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"我很喜欢童话。妈妈没离开前，给我买了很多很多的童话书。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"那时我们一家真的很幸福，我、妈妈......还有爸爸。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"可妈妈离开后，那些幸福就再也没有在我身上发生过了。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"我尝试把自己经历的一切写下来，展现给他人看，可没有人想要看到压抑和绝望。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"所以我才把每一句的句意都颠倒，让它们变成最美好的童话。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......可是我早就不看童话了。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"安娜......","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"（身体颤抖）","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"请、请不要叫那个名字......","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......对不起，我不是故意的。","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"相比其他人，你已经对我很温柔了。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"还有爱丽丝，她很担心你。","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"你认识爱丽丝？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯，我是跟着她一起来找你的。我刚和她联系了，她正在赶来。","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"爱丽丝......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你不想见她？","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"我知道她很忙，每天有很多很多事要处理......","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你是她非常重要的朋友。","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"其实......我今天曾无数次站在高处，然后向下望去......","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"但我口袋里装满了她写给我的信，我的手一直攥着它们。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"她鼓励我努力活下去，还和我说，我故事里的美梦总会到来。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"我不知道该相信自己，还是该相信她......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你完全可以相信她。","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"毕竟她是真正的仙女。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"仙女？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"等她来了你就知道了，她说要在你成年以前——","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clock","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":274},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"祥子下意识地抬头看向了时钟。","id":276},{"type":"text","text":"硕大的古钟悬挂于高墙之上，而时针与分针正在缓缓靠近，即将重合。","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"糟糕......","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"怎么了？","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝说要在成年以前......","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"你是指生日前？爱丽丝要给我过生日？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯，时间要来不及了......","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"没关系的，我很久都没有过过生日了。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"而且我已经不是小孩子了。人长大了，就不需要庆祝了。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":293},{"type":"charslot","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"就在祥子环顾四周之时，她的视线落在了一个物件上。","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"安，可以由我为你献上生日的祝福吗？","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......欸？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......好。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":308,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"那是一架钢琴。","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"月光洒在它的上面，仿佛它就是为了今夜而准备的。","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"就算爱丽丝的美梦不能如期而至，祥子也想用自己的方式去为安做些什么。","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在变成“大人”之前的最后一刻，就让我用这首安眠曲作为礼物送给你吧。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安","text":"......嗯！","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"sw","id":320},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"sw","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.6","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"祥子缓缓走上台阶，而安坐在台下。","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"心跳的节拍和倒数的指针一同，在两人之间逐渐变得清晰可闻。","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_intenseheartbeat","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"mh","id":328},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"mh","fadetime":"3","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clock","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"t","id":330},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"t","fadetime":"3","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"扑通，扑通。","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"嘀嗒，嘀嗒。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"1","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smoothpiano","volume":"1","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"祥子的双手在黑白琴键间游走着。","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"音符随流逝的时间跳跃，为女孩奇迹般的诞生献上最为真挚的祝福。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"感谢你来到这片大地。","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"希望你的未来一切顺利。","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"愿你的童心，永不泯灭。","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"随着最后一个音符落定，教堂的钟声恰好敲响。","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchbell","volume":"0.6","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"生日快乐，安......","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"祥子转身看向女孩，却发现她已经伏在桌上睡着，表情带着一丝香甜。","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"生日快乐，安。","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"charslot","id":365},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":370,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"贝娜还在教堂里等安醒过来，我们就在外面散散步吧。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"还好最后赶上了啊。","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"嗯，有惊无险，实在是太好了。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你最后给她创造了一个什么样的梦？","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"一个洁白的房间，干净得让人觉得不可能是现实的地方。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"在房间里，我先询问她愿不愿意进入我为她而造的梦境。","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝确实像位贵族小姐呢。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你不要信贝娜的那套说辞......","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"“进入梦境前，必须征得孩子的同意。”","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"这些都是梦城堡规定的必要程序。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"明白——","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那你在最后，还有和她说什么吗？","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我在梦里告诉安，她的文字真的很美，我希望她能一直坚持写下去。","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"无论何种风格、何种故事，甚至是不是童话都不重要。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯，这也是我想和她说的话。","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我将她笔下的角色一一展现在了她眼前。","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"爱吃水果的蛀牙叔叔、倒立行走的玩偶小姐......他们一起举办了一场茶会。","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"真好啊，要是安能一直在这个梦中就好了......","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"梦不是用来沉溺的。","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......？","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"再美好的梦，终究是要醒来的。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"即使现实生活一团乱麻，也要醒来吗？","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"明明你和贝娜都有这么强的源石技艺......","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"祥子，你有些误解童话和梦城堡的力量了。和现实比起来，我们的能力实在有限。","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我们能做的，不过是在孩子们内心的最深处，留下一颗种子。","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"它可能是年少时，心里觉得最重要的一件事，抑或是一个物品。","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"它不会时刻强调自己的存在，但它会在关键的时刻、一个人最脆弱的时刻，给予他力量。","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......我是不是有点太严肃了？","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"没有。你说这些话的时候，眼神看上去很坚定。","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我相信往后的日子里，每当安回想起你为她所造的美梦，都会拾起活下去的信心。","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"嗯，我也相信，但是我和你的理由可能略有不同。","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸？","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"在为她造梦前，我发现她心里已经有了一颗小小的种子。","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"信念的种子，并不是只有通过梦城堡的美梦才能种下——","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"多亏了你，祥子。","id":433},{"type":"dialog","id":434},{"type":"charslot","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是呀，祥子你钢琴弹得真的好好听啊！","id":436},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","duration":"0.7","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我之前就说你肯定是玩音乐的好手，之后罗德岛上的演出你必须参加哦！","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔，红豆，你就不要为难我啦......","id":444},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"text","text":"就在红豆和祥子打闹之时，爱丽丝从小匣子中拿出了一样东西。","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"祥子，你之前不是说会做奇怪的梦吗？","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"这个项链你随身带着，以后会少做一些噩梦。","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这个......我真的能收下吗？","id":452},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"放心收下就好了，不是什么贵重的东西，只是在上面施了点小法术。","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"欸——我也想要！","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你也做噩梦吗？","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"可能......也许有吧？我不记得了！","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"不，我能看出来，你从小到大睡眠质量一向很好。","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"欸——和你们这些仙女打交道真的好麻烦啊，一点秘密都没有！","id":464},{"type":"dialog","id":465},{"type":"charslot","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"听着身旁同事们聊天，祥子小心地戴上了项链。","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"一股温柔的凉意迅速从脖颈传递到全身。","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"啊，真美......","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝，红豆，你们看——","id":472},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":474},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":475},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":476},{"type":"text","text":"空无一人。","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"红豆？","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝？","id":480},{"type":"dialog","id":481},{"type":"charslot","id":482},{"type":"text","text":"祥子环顾四周。","id":483},{"type":"text","text":"空无一人。","id":484},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你们......人呢？","id":486},{"type":"dialog","id":487},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":488},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":489},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":490},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":491,"musicid":4},{"type":"text","text":"祥子开始往刚才的教堂走去，她的脚步不自觉地越来越快。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"贝娜！","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"安！","id":494},{"type":"dialog","id":495},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"nrun","id":496},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"nrun","fadetime":"2.5","id":497},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":498},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"0.6","id":499},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":500},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":501},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","channel":"a","loop":"true","id":503},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":504},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":505},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1.5","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸......？为什么会回到罗德岛......？","id":509},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_973_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的干员","text":"祥子小姐？","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的干员","text":"你还好吗？","id":512,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_973_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":514},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"n","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你、你还、好吗？","id":516},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（转身）——！","id":518},{"type":"dialog","id":519},{"type":"charslot","id":520},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":522},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":523},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你、你好？","id":525},{"type":"dialog","id":526},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":527},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":528},{"type":"charslot","id":529},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":530},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":531},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":532},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":533},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":534},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"是啊，一切都和以前一样......感觉就像做梦似的。","id":536},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":537},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸......做梦？","id":538},{"type":"dialog","id":539},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":540},{"type":"blocker","a